🚀 How to Use
Burn Raspberry Pi OS to an SD card.

Clone your repository (anywhere, e.g., /home/pi/WRO-2026-Future-Engineers-Team-Obsidian):

bash
git clone https://github.com/robotahmid07-debug/WRO-2026-Future-Engineers-Team-Obsidian.git
Run the installer:

bash
cd WRO-2026-Future-Engineers-Team-Obsidian
chmod +x scripts/install_dependencies.sh
./scripts/install_dependencies.sh
Reboot when prompted.

The robot will auto‑start on boot.

